    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Citywide Real Estate are delighted to present No. 26 Stocking Wood Copse to the market, a superb own-door ground floor apartment ideally positioned within this highly regarded and much sought-after development at the foothills of the Dublin Mountains.\nThis bright and spacious dual-aspect apartment is presented in very good condition throughout and benefits from well-proportioned accommodation and the added advantage of its own private entrance. The property is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers including first-time buyers, those looking to downsize and investors alike.\n\nThis apartment comprises of an entrance porch, open plan living / dining area, kitchen, 2x double bedrooms, one of which features an ensuite, and the main bathroom. \n\nOn entering the apartment, you are greeted with a crisp white décor and light-coloured wood flooring. There is a private balcony/patio area off the living room, perfect for enjoying alfresco dining in the afternoon/evenings.\n\nThe kitchen is located off the living area and features modern integrated appliances, stylish cream coloured fitted cabinets providing plenty of storage space, along with quartz countertops and white tiled flooring.\n\nThe spacious principle bedroom is to the rear of the apartment and looks out on a private walkway exclusive to the development. Generously sized wardrobes and storage cupboards are fitted alongside the bed to maximise floor space, and there is ample space for additional bedroom furniture or a study / work-from-home station, if required. A raised balcony is located off this room and runs the length of both bedrooms. The ensuite features a modern suite and pumped shower unit.\n\nThe second bedroom is another great size bedroom, and could suit a variety of uses, including a home office or guest bedroom, and features a large, fitted wardrobe. The main bathroom is fully tiled and has modern suite and shower fitted over the bath.\n\nA very spacious storage space is located off the hallway.\n\nThe property features gas fired central heating.\n\nThe apartment has one assigned carparking space in the development and boasts one visitor space for every two apartments.\n\nManagement Company Fee: 1,656 / Annum (2025/2026)\n\nFLOOR AREA\n\nLIVING / DINING AREA 4.59m x 4.61m\nKITCHEN 4.61m x 1.87m\nPRINCIPLE BEDROOM 4.09m x 3.33m\nENSUITE 1.87m x 1.77m\nBEDROOM TWO 3.94m x 3.14m\nBATHROOM 1.73m x 1.96m\n+ STORAGE ROOM\nTOTAL FLOOR AREA 70.39m2 (757 sq ft)\n\n\nLocation\n\nStocking Wood is a mature and exceptionally well-maintained development offering residents a peaceful setting while enjoying every conceivable amenity on its doorstep. Situated just off Stocking Lane, the location is second to none with a wealth of local services nearby including the Village Centre at White Pines, Tesco, SuperValu Knocklyon, Rathfarnham Shopping Centre and Dundrum Town Centre.\n\nThe area is particularly popular with families due to the excellent choice of highly regarded primary and secondary schools including St. Colmcille`s National Schools and Knocklyon Community School. There are also numerous recreational and sporting facilities nearby including Marlay Park, St. Enda`s Park, Ballyboden St. Enda`s GAA Club, Templeogue Tennis Club and a variety of walking and cycling routes in the Dublin Mountains.\nPublic transport is well catered for with several Dublin Bus routes servicing the area, while the M50 motorway is only minutes away, providing easy access to all major routes.\n\nViewing is highly recommended.\n\n\n(These particulars do not constitute an offer or contract, and whilst every effort has been made in preparing all descriptions, dimensions, maps, and plans, these details should not be relied upon as fact. Dimensions / Illustrations are for guideline purposes only and not to scale. CITYWIDE will not hold itself responsible for any inaccuracies contained therein.)\n\n\n"
      },
